  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "朝鮮之地，姬伯所保。宜人宜家，業處子孫。求事大喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e702d0ef00d7eae171363aaf6346d9b717a3de134a763d4dc15d748d0a3e3814",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f906a252bd70c52b73e9597eb6b7499ade4c5b8714f619606eedaf1991b7eae5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "金柱鐵關，膠固衛災。君子居之，安無憂疑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c6825d64cfb27bb411c5077c074c5da6bda76485a539f1c52f0d655f11c06588",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:94abf5704c387b1a81de11e90f0fb35153eb28f405fb63626eb5b6ea135a7ed8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "轉禍為福，喜來入屋。春城夏國，可以飲食。保全家室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1b37f2a5a1a52f62889506a07af7263b1ed739ce4b4c10a6befae5b6a98cc8fd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8e60aca7bd74efb8fb563ea9d4398c776d4738c4f46b209cfa2bec512f53e0c7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "水暴橫行，浮屋壞牆。泱泱溢溢，市師驚惶。居止不殆，與母相保。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2c98ae8a9582c817671b228477fc3c98dd98bc35409bf38e796acd7cde6a49b5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3a7fe4da9a8e07e2964af04450786a148d3feee775b8e77c8e04192dcdfa85e8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "虎豹熊羆，遊戲山隅。得其所欲，君子無憂。旅人失利，市空無人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d33b6ad8ade9bc8cf962d8fa3d8730c74a2ae38efe6b4c600cfcdf98b8aa8082",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:85641cb9b238a9cd853c8403df63b62e38c29282f726a18116ea09d5837245b2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "躬禮履仁，尚德止訟。宗邑已安，三伯無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f245af55feb1b08e0ef120c115b913d6a9f552d2e329709c61c58fdc4e612033",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:24f22aed4a4e448885f4cacc91f59b1f629e2a8f1684b99494aa9b83d84cf99b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "江淮易服，元黃朱飾。靈公夏徵，哀禍無極。高位崩巔，失其寵室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c668bfd713aa3b968f84fe912a28473c9f06ada4476bf2c3033945ee29f807cc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5a5dac3b404241c688888af960cb294bcc2c6392542d3fb8be9c15d7595cdc41"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "不虞之患，禍至無門。奄忽暴卒，痛傷我心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7487218f1adbaf72f73d8864bf729720c5ecd766d4964ade673e0465bfbc611e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:192e4248a3a06562085e917184a03f76bd05796d9c21d2553d9721e06ae398ea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "三塗五嶽，去危入室。凶禍不作，桀盜堯服。失其寵福，貴人有疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:67b4a764850f17f99a79bafd14f37d34ce6c0b9989d62d3a921e6d1986341e74",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7a7e1f6f7844e1253278ca6b7d9d5ae6e7ae5eb93da85d05f0b3c191c2226c46"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "配合相迎，利之四鄉。昏以為期，明星煌煌。欣喜奭懌，所言得償。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b00784daa4cd5cffadefe4d7e51bc311963b3b0e9caeede6f7e2e1dec8f10116",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6942ed597e269785ce207b39f362a77906835e973438dc53f1553eb513e06f20"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "三首六身，莫適所閑。更伏搖動，動失事便。箕子佯狂，國乃不昌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4e479d5c9867d8d2be85090e7fb721017992e2ec3933c93ec17d9e8b35b5c1a3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:81c3baa7af63e82353db37f52364b3d5d48399ecf9e798cc187bff66411be877"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "虎臥山隅，鹿過後胊。弓矢設張，猬為功曹。伏不敢起，遂全其軀。得我羙章之。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e91758bb1b324233062678b46312c7c866bde57dcde8ffc46ea3f4f9dee2c64c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a1918b2c9de6125e056df9730e754d6a158566836aaeea105592f03d771843d9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "麟鳳執獲，英雄失職。自衛反魯，畏昧不起。福祿訖己。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4c48425c459b0744747b882cc20a40c49525ee4f7bce7c658e2927be5f7be81b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c55e48254bef6cb532c2ce4c9e46d1dee52c8898d023ffaae4204d357e92ab00"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "欒子作殃，伯氏誅傷。州犁奔楚，失其寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4533b1bf3e2aa97e78026c6af065cb57a3dd1e9158c362f9be4e5b7c3cd045db",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:210c9a9f832c19ac3bd6914f2e69d9183fe21d5d40f3fba1a34ae45a50edaa43"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "黃帝出遊，駕龍乘馬。東至泰山，南過齊魯。王良御右，文武何咎。不利市賈。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d9ba5f719e98c713b0c34cbd5b2d26b7e481bd00ddc03a85b6eef6014a4d3cd0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9ff6a9db1a8246fc3fc0e1319fca66461800374279914c1f87a30c0b0e3fe11f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "齊魯爭言，戰於龍門。搆怨致禍，三世不安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f75c070e23730616b31325f18a26349dc09bcaae98cf9aa13b3356022e98efd0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0d7eb4db9163dfc432bb47b41cef52fdc786da6aa00f1c058fdaad55629f7d65"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "道禮和德，仁不相賊。君子往之，樂有其利。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47d4637634c641da084408c370489765e370f4e3541807c4494f79be68dbe122",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:40aa910a79348df0f1548a35bb2e185f863912e9f858bd01a11775336055c376"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "嫗妒公姥，毀益亂類。使我家憤，利不得遂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eede74079ca2220a677ecf721985e82129de37a67be41958f1ea2128ab9f6031",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:db2400baab811d650787be7d41628563865dafcd7c1553cca0f3f3d2022ee2b9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "一巢九子，同公共母。柔順利貞，君子不殆。福祿所在。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6fd222d313b760d011e182a903b1e289f6c2cb627a6396950bef210d290a81d2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dec20d4e1b1af0b8e1cb1ae9779d4d977d64e5fec201ca6660119c515fd3e15c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "崔嵬北嶽，天神貴客。溫仁正直，主布恩德。閔哀不已，蒙受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:08f0189fa770cb106745a9a81d7dbba278c596c8ecac39f4d15c127f2724de2e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8b8eb6b677c1ae0adaa0f3e49fb4e09e485abfc1c59fb81b922205a06b22b13"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "三蛆逐蠅，陷墮釜中。灌沸淹殪，與母長訣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4b799ffc12148ef46638e6acf8467c62365a869ba5822b4600c696c63e5b81d1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6953deeb7b5516cc3e2a379af84b05a1393087d653d25b50c2e409b5ce8df849"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "東山西陵，高峻難升。滅夷掘壘，使道不通。商旅無功，復反其邦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:614ce1780f1d08a4024a248f050bcb56bbf0fa7da0567ff8b6ec5f5ea55ebf96",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8a062d99f99ff0a454d40b966f2144e851d1598416b080227dd4658433e51b9b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "常德自如，不逢禍殃，福祿自來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:40fa77e867f502ca51e802a67abc792daa8d4297b278a9cf8d5bc07e1c645d24",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0c87b133bb80577bd258d78ff1b64a59ee67f409fbe4016d26e73b8f3b2e9562"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "范子妙材，戮辱傷膚。後相秦國，封為應侯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2870db8ab3093c4cbbed0e92b7ac2daeca75a62887fbeb1b6d17f994539aa577",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f2c7f27b6fe1cc41f185d4eadfcc77a90127df972ed35745b6324c9bceff7802"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "狼虎結謀，相聚為儔。同嚙牛羊，道絕不通。病我商人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6eb2ba84aa55797d88091ee4073940b990986b3a4848a408ea02faad4fe5f0d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6d55b59915b89124d1d03f073fa19e0762d4eb902739ef7cdb94b047b6ec3cf5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "不宜杜公，與我爭訟。媒伯無禮，自令塞壅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ad6c8c81e9bb0df8b8f63e0b517091fca186ecdd976bc01eb83246b5e1178405",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:17354892433adbc014c830c5c329312830f44e39cafa1d63705383afd344dddb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "上天樓臺，登拜受福，喜慶大來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:32ce9bbb499f235376b52c6e367362679d30030725181ceabcc6937309f76f49",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:be0b054fdafc684acfa6813560f486b92f64034b7a705c2a14c78e753ce77293"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "三羊上山，東至平康。黃龍服箱，南至魯陽。完其珮囊，執綏車中。行人有慶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d108deee82fd33cce57ecb9a5d02b5764d2f43a59ff4ebcb0546e976da4c4127",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2ab92eb9337534f9b6614802c48d0aa4328daeb77313ae16501841bb12d44a70"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "天地閉塞，仁智隱伏。商旅不行，利深難得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2dfe1c837260316fea7597483e2e08e69b47df549dc5582aa12e84554f7ac40a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d29fee2c78cd2af93816d0e1ed546ed6e01e8ca0f629a52867ac45534ee0bd3f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "延陵適魯，觀樂太史。車轔白顛，知秦興起。卒兼其國，一統為主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f974fd1b6e75a17ce467f4a2135b421c96d4cd70324efb9cd186ecfcce5c3eef",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:372796affacfe067bb7d431df29860ed4435c9515d60474c967499ef2709596e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "櫜戢甲兵，歸放馬牛。徑路開通，國無凶憂。一下有朽牆難鑿，疾病難治。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:959a5d4ed30dc109418eb94853546e4821cded7adeec01b1ce713337114d5236",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:54ed6eafc9d1c86c2125bfcea292cb3545747fa8e03640597d459f63099a8fb8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "牛驥同堂，郭氏以亡。國破為壚，君奔走趍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d261f77387d1dfe20a5b07ec119fcd25020652ed6adf641b3ba90784bbd8a793",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9795683d5c00eb29d11cc18ed75cfadb6ce7603496f3e0ba2318a0893cd59f27"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "大尾小腰，重不可搖。棟撓壤壞，臣為君憂。湯火之言，消不為患，使我復安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8ec0293377c77bd0788c29cf010d7ac626b318b37990d1d8a707190d5d800478",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2050b5f941f9f8ae140e13e69aa9e01c91df99398739488861cf284b31ad4cce"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "太乙置酒，樂正起舞。萬福攸同，可以安處。保我齯齒。一下有暗空無餌，不利為旅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f40fe65d540f4039bac678d57f9dc4173160880cc15d7d2b2b5532420e21f582",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:53cf64f04cc63cbd2f29b9319bf8a477b63f91ca2b8b7fe100d4fc47fc1faf6a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "飲酒醉酗，跳起爭鬥。伯傷叔僵，東家治喪。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:11d214c9d8ed0b82fabe880cadad6a58175e3d6b4e5dd1b14079ea60df6162b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5b7c2e8842f19929719d112377d038c253c20fae94ed38e2d2a003e2ba5563b9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "陵險難登，澗中多石。車馳 擊，重載傷軸。擔負善躓，跌踒右足。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:06351f032fd4ad0fd985ff2b0163b9eaa865355a27c889392ecc8f423596a541",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a497fc9068fc910175828ccecfcfb4162aa537b76fc066cbff0afc119df49e94"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "爭訟不已，更相咨詢。張李弱口，被髮北走。一下有耳順從心，躬行至仁。不須以兵，天下太平。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f1558acc1fa67e57a6a2ca248f5de569080ca8da5247c2b982fb3ae7b49eb382",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fa1d1e17dc376440d9c7682f26267d03744406a9d2ba82a384c15a9faeba9e70"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "心志無良，傷破妄行。觸牆觝壁，不見戶房。先王閉關，商旅委棄。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c41be333fae1c244624dcaf8ed3b9d0497c786ac22ce2f4407730d9f3785c3d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65ab91bd68ba49de7cfecc8e0f924b53786c0b9bd7bfc3827aca588bacbf84c0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "鸋鴂鴟鴞，治成御災。綏德安家，周公勤勞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2852497ba2cfb2d9afbd51efb70a556c297dbf4eb3b03bc5b3f6a8888d870ad2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d2f1abdf2e67e7c3acf6455246e24d86c6ced02beb04f631adb5e3c6dc3bb9c9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "清人高子，久屯外野。逍遙不歸，思我慈母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e2c19812a51c010597b19198ff40560881e09b546ccf7a19c7f8d4f4950cc0b9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ca87c900bee02ae912b172fa31b4a17ab20a163343be4491ad7b47e5135d8c48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "兩虎爭鬥，股創無處。不成仇讎，行解卻去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2930b649b0d866d19013449aa86325b54eff92bc08125ae4b08741952bdd3779",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:71b81aacfb9cb0f6802ae9479d7d1e3f2f8c8958223523481af4dba0c7661c81"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "天女推床，不成文章。南箕無舌，飯多沙糠。虐眾盜名，雄雞折頸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bb3aecf62f4f346f9103c804815b87ba3e537e5b2dd842d7dc21b7c4703407a9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f03689d8ef64def0e9e947adfbe677837bd6b846811c1519b26967eba3245900"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "太子扶蘇，出於遠郊。佞幸成邪，改命生憂。慈母之恩，無路致之。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:12e913bfa2866bcbcda801100e6ab68a442ad35576690990755400a03aca9298",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d20ec55088252d00651f03324898e6a1496ad78b0f57f9d90c6a261a2170a3ff"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "寒暑相推，一明一微。赫赫宗周，榮光滅衰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:417e7c36e0f6b6220ae402a6ea3d3b695992c0fe76fe18a145dce31085b3a25f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b7b2b308f0dbaad69f8a975e2eb623da91eb36ad9a85c925c17fa648c2be68e5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "雞狗相望，仁道篤行。不吠昏明，各安其鄉。周鼎和餌，國富民有。八極蒙祐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dbbf20fb0a773dc96348417be14e3ee9057fbdfa5b439d7a483f37b31afc157d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b19d173830a2f9f7dc843a3206096c60b9ec7b8c73593cb9bcf1ab13ab0fd7ff"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "窗牖戶房，通利明光。賢智輔聖，仁施大行。家給人足，海內殷昌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:344ebbacb7646d84fc8e103a95224c6a10d641d5986810719440d3ab2010076b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df141ac51c520cbb80d22ed6e38429a10e99bc320e14d7f7e2db6522c967e370"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "雨雪三月，鳥獸飢乏。旅人失宜，利不可得。機言解患，以療篤難，危身復安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:725c9c13eba26ddd5b78ab1e79d238a970820d509613e7b335053ed7f59981e4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:edf40dc3adfc2edbb5f0269f094adb7a70cc1ebe85b320548077a3a3c49420a3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "白鶴銜珠，夜食為明。膏潤優渥，國歲年豐。中子來同，見惡不凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6bde52f0fbfcff5d794b63605cdf05167025a196da25dc4b65b01383f5890197",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cab8a0521e9225cd234d27182806509ee6f1f3109cc43fe10de41d5be1f3ca7b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "從豕牽羊，與虎相逢，雖驚不凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dfe20a0ae3fd57810610175e19b6ab26e4aa2951605d65136be0e5d842805f2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5972d1b05a44cf41a94f4d6eacf9f6cbf5b9c1eabadd7d678d6362679e2e4c6a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "鳧雁啞啞，以水為宅。雌雄相和，心志娛樂。得其所欲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7fc2d3ed8bacd09423d757eb67bd4138f253025f7707c8b3f6aaf97441e100e2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fca2641354cd6580afc324f7788b18d0a1fe7e1c9a48ceaf6b6458e0e82cd3cc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "逐狐平原，水遏我前。深不可涉，暮無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3b300970b421d923d66f8caf061bbf9e1e79a60e696e7bcc597bc12b5babdb88",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ed25203eeaebf46b0ded3e01fedfb98b00218d968acafed7ec946ae42930f8be"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "窟室蓬戶，寒賤所處。千里望煙，渙散四方。形體滅亡，下入深淵，終不見君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d8004de5981187c75bc6a150ebed34be99d7282750436a4312256e5bab81dbd1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ea62ff6c679efd92b0a09295386529f451fc64c6ec061e8e20265876ce3a09cd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "桀紂之主，悖不堪輔。貪榮為人，必定其咎。聚斂積實，野在都邑，未來我室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2145492b97a8585b9fd5d97e9c83ae8931ac3c269ed2b8b4f5f72bc46ed5e7d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6eb377ec3d5c30538b6c5e6f40936e5f841485e178964be9aca9f6ea6039ab40"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "倉庫盈億，年歲有息。商人留連，雖久有得。陰多陽少，因地就力。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aff1b01092ccac7e3a0686c0a076c3c67f9b4c493ede94dd4fb7935799158600",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:08768174072dca995a3825cd6edea02f62f115835edfaeed3e0c42323378a1de"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "泰山不然，釣鯉失綸。魚不可得，利去我北。一作三人同福，以興周國，君子安息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ca7c71d29428afe772a8d997ff4f69f40536f238e396623a3f86be4d4d186c29",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:48e2e44f2d9f231e8461ea673fb0b031b2ed9cb6af6350efb7e7f40a3bf16d11"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "童女無媒，不利動搖。安其室廬，待母動憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c091cf72a7bde844974e393a4f59b468dee9560775f68395c6f12595a2dca7f7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6f0dc62b9c9c08c49f711e09995afbcf67e99086b545d1cc1830ff085b2dc6eb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "載風雲母，遊觀東海。鼓翼千里，見吾愛子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:814586d2bc07e38ffeda0b26a944601b5bd99d218a8810d1ecdf80e472da31bc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8c3407673e97c39a5be0632021f0a7e999c27708829d8720ef31d0a8606a3284"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "鴻盜我襦，逃於山隅。不見其跡，使伯心憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:20984c2400e5cd4fb867e6ba8cd49d58a9c78a9566b00e9ccb0b4aa6e11e915b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3ba0929da537ad8fe8709af768b5ebb5a1bf12a342f0647a322b9c8b5d522c82"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "夜視失明，不利遠鄉。閉門塞牖，福為我母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cb4d0b9f58116519143986e44e6f99e603e574835fd2e3113a6d1dc4e80b8b87",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f3485bc29f55965cb29bf3d4ce32296136599e911bd2eb4a592ef9d49c97e0b3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "三狗逐兔，于東門路。利以進取，商人有得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5cad954b68fc75a7cde38bb5c43e29689f580d15895f7f3a1390bc381d48a3a8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:79d628341bb54c15928ec693a0613d11d7fc7d847e39434caf977a70f5ce9ac7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "武王不豫，周公禱謝。載璧秉珪，安寧如故。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6e4286a9c6043074566a6a3a46f412b5e4a73887201f37c7c8a36ffe0b4c3270",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a52f41e24b5abb68e1533d5a22f27905e56690d4df99915ef3880fc844eb65a6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "同載共車，中道別去。爵級不進，君子下輿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7be233bab22535c6ee03873be9a72f27163c7392f89973ab336cc09437cc2ed8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3356b1e23d99ccd9cc2ff331fd17e1dbfab0d207efa484de04cb94d1b05d4b12"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "六雁俱飛，遊戲稻池。大飲多食，食飽無患。一下有舉事不遂，商旅作僓。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5a541ffd918768cc0385b314e4c25488f26431abacfbf201ff4aa16f60312794",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1bf9d34be6defba84080f6ef2205b5be6d448d00a52fceb132097640d7ad475e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 26,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "符左契右，相與合齒。乾以坤利，季生六子。長大成就，風言如母，不利為咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7de0a956f66989ce60f2555cf09c8e6aab6422212cfcaa68a380f9c71e3cfd77",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:13ba54913ba716043ac85c031174556b242ddc1ba6e188ae3a4460da3a087877"
    }
  ]
}
